 * Solving for A:
 *	A = X^n + X^(n-1) + ... + 1
 *	A*X = X^(n+1) + ....... + X

 * A(X-1) = X^(n+1) - 1.
 *
 * A = [X^(n+1) - 1] / (X - 1)
 */
